# Cistern Hall's overflow channel with the suit on (CIPlay cistern_hall_acidsuit, 11-11; in a test world 'CI ...', under
# CIGapsWatchHealth, no CIGapsSuit): the suit from the box west of the mouth (53 -62.5), then the acid takes nothing
# (expect unhurt) all the way to the overflow locker and back. cistern_hall_acid is the run without the suit and the valve.
island Cistern Hall keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm
at 54 -64
use chflowsuits
expect shown chflowacid
walk 54 -64 to 60 -65 to 62 -63.5 to 62 -58.5 to 62 -54.5
wait 6
expect unhurt
open Overflow locker
wait 2
walk 62 -54.5 to 62 -58.5 to 62 -63.5 to 62 -65.5
expect unhurt
